# Root Docker build-context excludes — every image in this repo (apps/*/Dockerfile,
# demo/two-orgs/Dockerfile.rendezvous) builds with the workspace root as context, and a `COPY . .`
# would otherwise ship multi-GB build artifacts and VCS history into every image build.
/target
**/node_modules
.git
*.log
demo/**/.ca
infra/**/.ca
